4f:["$","p",null,{"children":["Note ",["$","code",null,{"children":"query_cmd"}]," above: a worker property can be computed at startup by\nrunning a command (not a shell; the string is split into words shell-style\nwith ",["$","code",null,{"children":"shlex"}]," and executed directly, with a cleared environment) and\nsplitting its output on newlines, one value per line. ",["$","code",null,{"children":"nproc"}]," is the\ncanonical use."]}]
